WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.901
-Congrats, by the way,

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:04.003
on the new Marvel chapter
in your life.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.004
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Oh, thank you.

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:07.373
Mysterio.
-They know.

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:09.775
Dude, it was a big deal
when the trailer came out.

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:11.711
You're gonna be Mysterio
in the new "Spider-Man."

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:13.813
-Yes.
-And I was psyched about that.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:17.416
And I saw that Ryan Reynolds,
our pal, posted a --

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.918
I'm gonna cross this out

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.453
'cause there was a couple
dirty words.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.522
You can't see it.
-Oh, wow.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:26.158
-Ryan Reynolds posted a photo
of you and Hugh Jackman

00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:27.793
at a holiday party.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:29.696
-That's Photoshopped.
We weren't actually together.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.097
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:34.700
-And it said, "These dudes
said it was a sweater party."

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.805
So, you --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:42.641
Yeah. I think it's the greatest
photo -- greatest reaction.

00:00:42.641 --> 00:00:45.644
I just loved that.
And I thought it was great.

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:48.814
So then,
you finally joined Instagram.

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:50.549
-Yeah.
-You, what -- I mean --

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:52.084
[ Cheers and applause ]
-You're the last holdout!

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:53.853
-Thank you!
I mean --

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:56.889
-You're the last holdout, dude.
We've been waiting for you.

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.425
-The last person
to join Instagram.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.025
-Yes, Instagram's
been waiting for you.

00:01:00.025 --> 00:01:01.794
-Yeah, I came to the conclusion

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:03.896
that nobody cares
about anything anymore,

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:06.366
so I should join Instagram.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:09.869
-No, people -- They care.
-Oh, they do?

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:11.037
-Yeah.
That's why they join Instagram.

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:12.972
-Oh, yeah, no.
-They care about everybody.

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:14.840
-I'm not even sure
if I'm on Instagram.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.175
-You're definitely on.
-I am?

00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:18.210
-I've seen you on Instagram.
-No, I'm on Instagram.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:19.745
-Yeah, you are.
-I'm on Instagram.

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:22.214
-Well, you took that photo --
That was that photo.

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:26.753
And then, you took --
You Photoshopped that photo.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:30.056
And then, you,
Deadpool, you're on Wolverine --

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.458
Is that bubble boy?
-Yes, that is bubble --

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:34.460
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.662
And Spider-Man, too,
in the corner.

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:36.863
-Yeah, that's Spidey
over there in the corner.

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:38.598
-That's Spider-Man
in the corner.

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.432
That's actually
a guy named Bosslogic.

00:01:40.432 --> 00:01:41.467
He did that actually.

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:42.635
-Oh, is that
who did that for you?

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:43.836
-Yeah, we should give
a shout-out to that guy,

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:46.305
'cause I have
no artistic skill whatsoever.

00:01:46.305 --> 00:01:47.573
There'd be no possibility
that I could pull that off.

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:49.609
-Bosslogic?
-Bosslogic, yeah.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.544
-"Baas" or "Boss"?
-I don't know, man.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.445
-I mean, do you know somebody
named Bosslogic?

00:01:53.445 --> 00:01:54.813
-That's the guy
who did that picture --

00:01:54.813 --> 00:01:56.983
Bosslogic.
"Ba-sla-jik."

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.851
-"Ba-sla-jik"?
-"Ba-sla-jik."

00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:01.120
-His name is "Bas-laji."
-"Bas-laji."

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.655
-Oh, Bosslogic.
-It's Bosslogic.

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:04.090
-Oh, my gosh.
Yeah, no, of course.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.292
-He's amazing.
-Nikolai Baslajic, yeah.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.461
[ Laughter ]
He's a CIA agent.

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:11.497
He's wanted in 30 countries.
Yes!

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:14.500
-Baslajica?
-Yes, in Baslajica.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.368
Baslajica -- that's where
he's from, of course.

00:02:16.368 --> 00:02:17.770
But, dude,
here's you as Mysterio.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.072
Look at this.
You came on the screen,

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:21.040
people went "Whoa!"
-Yeah.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:25.177
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.177 --> 00:02:27.880
-Oh, and how's --
See what I'm saying, dude?

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.083
-Who knew --
Who knew that --

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:32.218
The thing is, is like,
those are the actual

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.187
green lasers
that I shoot out of my hands.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:35.788
-Yes, I've known that for years.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.389
-That's what I can do,
and that's why they hired me.

00:02:37.389 --> 00:02:39.826
-And finally, you can put that
to good use in a film.

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:42.328
-Yeah, finally!
Finally!

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:43.696
-I mean, you play tricks

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.298
when you're in movie theaters
and stuff.

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:46.465
-When I was a kid,
my dad's like,

00:02:46.465 --> 00:02:47.567
"What are we gonna do
with this kid."

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.602
-Laser hands!
Oh, my gosh.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.004
And now, here you are
in a big-time movie.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.772
-Yeah!
It paid off, man.

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:55.675
-How's Tom Holland?
-He's great, dude.

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.911
-Dude, he's great?
-He's awesome.

00:02:57.911 --> 00:02:59.912
-Yeah, he's good.
-He's the nicest guy.

00:02:59.912 --> 00:03:01.147
In the world.
-He is.

00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:04.116
-I'm super into him
as Spider-Man.

00:03:04.116 --> 00:03:05.718
-Yeah.
But I think it's more fun

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:06.852
what you're doing on Instagram.

00:03:06.852 --> 00:03:08.053
You're kind of
trolling him a little bit.

00:03:08.053 --> 00:03:09.255
-My God.
This whole Instagram thing...

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:11.257
You're really into it.
-Dude, I'm totally --

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:13.860
-You are obsessed
with my Instagram.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:16.595
-Oh, yes, your Instagram.
-[ Laughing ]

00:03:16.595 --> 00:03:19.965
Yeah, follow Jake on Instagram,
@jakegyllenhaal.

00:03:19.965 --> 00:03:21.067
-That's my name.
-Yeah.

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:22.101
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:23.302
I'm surprised you got that name

00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:24.703
'cause you weren't
on Instagram so long.

00:03:24.703 --> 00:03:25.971
Somebody else probably took it.

00:03:25.971 --> 00:03:27.774
-I think someone
snatched it up pretty early.

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:29.508
-Did you have to buy it
from a stranger?

00:03:29.508 --> 00:03:30.677
-[ Laughs ]
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:32.178
-That said
that they were Jake Gyllenhaal?

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:34.213
-No.
Someone got it for me.

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:35.948
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.948 --> 00:03:37.616
-Just tell me.
-I got friends.

00:03:37.616 --> 00:03:39.118
-Was it Baslajic?
-Baslajic.

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:40.452
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.452 --> 00:03:44.056
-I don't know about that guy.
That guy can do anything.

00:03:44.056 --> 00:03:45.625
You want it done,
call Baslajic.

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:46.859
-Bosslogic is freaking out
right now.

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:48.094
-He will take care of it, man.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:49.595
He will take care
of all of it.

00:03:49.595 --> 00:03:50.897
-I had it.
Someone had it.

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:52.464
I don't know how he had it,
but we had it.

00:03:52.464 --> 00:03:54.500
-Well, you have it now.
It's @jakegyllenhaal.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:58.971
And you posted this funny thing,
I thought, of Tom Holland.

00:03:58.971 --> 00:04:01.340
I think he was
just doing an interview.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.076
You took all the vocals --
all the audio

00:04:04.076 --> 00:04:06.412
out of his interview,
added this weird music.

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:08.514
Just watch.

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:18.524
♪♪

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:19.592
♪♪

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:23.996
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:04:23.996 --> 00:04:27.432
-Oh!
-Yeah.

00:04:27.432 --> 00:04:29.669
-He's just...amazing.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:30.936
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.936 --> 00:04:32.572
-He's just dreamy.
-He just is.

